			(property "Description" "800ps high-speed rail-to-rail input comparator with LVDS outputs, 2.4-5.5V, adjustable hysteresis/latch (LE/HYS), shutdown (SHDN), 12-pin WQFN 3x3mm with exposed pad (RVK). EP = thermal pad: connect to VEE/ground plane per TI QFN guidance; datasheet gives no RVK-specific instruction"
